flowchart LR
  Prompt[Prompt] --> Session[Session context]
  File[Desktop attachment] --> Session
  Phone[Phone image/audio/note] --> Session
  Scout[GitHub Scout report] --> Session
  Session --> Consent{Saved context enabled?}
  Consent -->|yes| Retrieve[Retrieve relevant vault notes]
  Consent -->|no| Council[Council]
  Retrieve --> Council
  Search[Optional web search] --> Council
  Council --> Verdict[Verdict]
  Verdict --> Vault[Write decision memory]
